          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/ai-employees/operations">Operations Employee</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/ai-employees/custom">Custom Employee</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/ai-employees" style="color: var(--ink-black); font-weight: 600;">Explore All Employees →</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4 class="footer-heading">Solutions</h4>
        <ul class="footer-list">
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/solutions#sales">Revenue & Sales</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/solutions#marketing">Brand & Content</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/solutions#operations">Operations & Finance</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/solutions#customer-experience">Customer Experience</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/solutions#enterprise">Enterprise Solutions</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/solutions#enterprise">Enterprise VPC</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4 class="footer-heading">Resources & Agentic</h4>
        <ul class="footer-list">
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/resources">Knowledge Hub</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/blog">Blog & Insights</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/resources#guides">Deployment Guides</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://ollasuper.com/pricing">Pricing & Plans</a></li>
